==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You need a meatshield and counter to Winged Pigge here. This does not have to be Ramen, though he does fulfill both roles. It's advisable to save Ramen for a harder Angel stage though, so use any anti-Angel Ubers you have that can deal with Winged Pigge instead.

